Browser DOM Static Bundle Demo
===============================================================================

This project is the executable static-web example for `mech bundle-web`. It configures browser DOM access and runs `demo.mec` through the standard browser project lifecycle.

Build the supported browser WASM package, bundle the project, and serve the result:

```sh
python3 scripts/build-wasm.py --profile browser
mech bundle-web examples/browser-dom-demo --out dist/browser-dom-demo
python -m http.server 9000 -d dist/browser-dom-demo
```

Open `http://127.0.0.1:9000/`. The project reads `Ada` from the DOM and writes the computed greeting, output, and status back to the page.
